<span class="ltx_bibblock"><span id="bib.bib7.7" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">
Xiang Deng, Yu Gu, Boyuan Zheng, Shijie Chen, Samual Stevens, Boshi Wang, Huan Sun, and Yu Su.
</span>
</span>
<span class="ltx_bibblock"><span id="bib.bib7.8" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Mind2web: Towards a generalist agent for the web.
