          <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">18:</span>
          
          
        <span id="alg1.l18.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">   Let </span><math id="alg1.l18.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\bm{K}_{\mathcal{I}_{t}}^{h}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mi>𝑲</mi><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℐ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mi>h</mi></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\bm{K}_{\mathcal{I}_{t}}^{h}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="alg1.l18.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold"> be the key matrix rows for indices in the current frame </span><math id="alg1.l18.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{I}_{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℐ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{I}_{t}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="alg1.l18.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">.
</span>
</div>
<div id="alg1.l19" class="ltx_listingline">
          <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">19:</span>
          
          
        <span id="alg1.l19.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">   </span><math id="alg1.l19.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(\bm{K}_{\mathcal{I}_{t}}^{h})^{\top}\approx\bm{Q}_{t}^{h}\bm{R}_{t}^{h}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi>𝑲</mi><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℐ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mi>h</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo>≈</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>𝑸</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>h</mi></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>𝑹</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>h</mi></msubsup></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(\bm{K}_{\mathcal{I}_{t}}^{h})^{\top}\approx\bm{Q}_{t}^{h}\bm{R}_{t}^{h}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="alg1.l19.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold"> </span><span id="alg1.l19.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="float:right;"><math id="alg1.l19.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\triangleright" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>⊳</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\triangleright</annotation></semantics></math> Rank-<math id="alg1.l19.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="r" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>r</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">r</annotation></semantics></math> QR decomposition
</span>
</div>
<div id="alg1.l20" class="ltx_listingline">
          <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">20:</span>
          
          
        <span id="alg1.l20.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">   </span><math id="alg1.l20.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\bm{P}_{t}^{h}\leftarrow\bm{Q}_{t}^{h}(\bm{Q}_{t}^{h})^{\top}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>𝑷</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>h</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>𝑸</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>h</mi></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi>𝑸</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>h</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>⊤</mo></msup></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\bm{P}_{t}^{h}\leftarrow\bm{Q}_{t}^{h}(\bm{Q}_{t}^{h})^{\top}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="alg1.l20.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold"> </span><span id="alg1.l20.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="float:right;"><math id="alg1.l20.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\triangleright" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>⊳</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\triangleright</annotation></semantics></math> Projector onto current frame’s key subspace
</span>
</div>
<div id="alg1.l21" class="ltx_listingline">
          <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">21:</span>
          
          
        <span id="alg1.l21.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">   Initialize redundancy scores </span><math id="alg1.l21.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\bm{\rho}^{h}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mi>𝝆</mi><mi>h</mi></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\bm{\rho}^{h}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="alg1.l21.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold"> for tokens in </span><math id="alg1.l21.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{I}_{&lt;t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℐ</mi><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{I}_{&lt;t}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="alg1.l21.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">.
</span>
</div>
<div id="alg1.l22" class="ltx_listingline">
          <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">22:</span>
          
          
        <span id="alg1.l22.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">   for each past visual token </span><math id="alg1.l22.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="i\in\mathcal{I}_{&lt;t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℐ</mi><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i\in\mathcal{I}_{&lt;t}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="alg1.l22.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold"> do
</span>
</div>
<div id="alg1.l23" class="ltx_listingline">
          <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">23:</span>
          
          
        <span id="alg1.l23.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">     </span><math id="alg1.l23.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k_{i}^{h}\leftarrow i" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>k</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>h</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k_{i}^{h}\leftarrow i</annotation></semantics></math><span id="alg1.l23.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">-th row of </span><math id="alg1.l23.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\bm{K}^{h}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mi>𝑲</mi><mi>h</mi></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\bm{K}^{h}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="alg1.l23.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">
</span>
</div>
<div id="alg1.l24" class="ltx_listingline">
          <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">24:</span>
          
          
        <span id="alg1.l24.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">     </span><math id="alg1.l24.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\rho_{i}^{h}\leftarrow\lVert k_{i}^{h}(\bm{I}-\bm{P}_{t}^{h})\rVert_{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>ρ</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>h</mi></msubsup><mo rspace="0.1389em" stretchy="false">←</mo><msub><mrow><mo fence="true" lspace="0.1389em" rspace="0em">∥</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>k</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>h</mi></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>𝑰</mi><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mi>𝑷</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>h</mi></msubsup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo fence="true" lspace="0em">∥</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\rho_{i}^{h}\leftarrow\lVert k_{i}^{h}(\bm{I}-\bm{P}_{t}^{h})\rVert_{2}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="alg1.l24.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold"> </span><span id="alg1.l24.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="float:right;"><math id="alg1.l24.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\triangleright" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>⊳</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\triangleright</annotation></semantics></math> Residual norm (non-redundancy)
</span>
</div>
<div id="alg1.l25" class="ltx_listingline">
          <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">25:</span>
          
          
        <span id="alg1.l25.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">   end for</span>
</div>
<div id="alg1.l26" class="ltx_listingline">
          <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">26:</span>
          
          
        <span id="alg1.l26.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">   </span><math id="alg1.l26.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\tau^{h}\leftarrow\text{Percentile}_{1-\gamma}\big(\{\rho_{j}^{h}:j\in\mathcal{I}_{&lt;t}\}\big)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>τ</mi><mi>h</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><msub><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_bold">Percentile</mtext><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>γ</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">(</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><msubsup><mi>ρ</mi><mi>j</mi><mi>h</mi></msubsup><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℐ</mi><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\tau^{h}\leftarrow\text{Percentile}_{1-\gamma}\big(\{\rho_{j}^{h}:j\in\mathcal{I}_{&lt;t}\}\big)</annotation></semantics></math><span id="alg1.l26.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold"> </span><span id="alg1.l26.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="float:right;"><math id="alg1.l26.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\triangleright" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>⊳</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\triangleright</annotation></semantics></math> Redundancy threshold
</span>
</div>
<div id="alg1.l27" class="ltx_listingline">
          <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">27:</span>
          
          
        <span id="alg1.l27.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">   </span><span id="alg1.l27.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="float:right;"><math id="alg1.l27.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\triangleright" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>⊳</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\triangleright</annotation></semantics></math> Combine Scores and Select Tokens
</span>
</div>
<div id="alg1.l28" class="ltx_listingline">
          <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">28:</span>
          
          
        <span id="alg1.l28.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">   Initialize final scores </span><math id="alg1.l28.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\hat{\bm{\psi}}^{h}\in\mathbb{R}^{n}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>𝝍</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>h</mi></msup><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi>ℝ</mi><mi>n</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\hat{\bm{\psi}}^{h}\in\mathbb{R}^{n}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="alg1.l28.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">.
</span>
</div>
<div id="alg1.l29" class="ltx_listingline">
          <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">29:</span>
          
          
        <span id="alg1.l29.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">   for each token index </span><math id="alg1.l29.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="i\in\mathcal{C}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒞</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i\in\mathcal{C}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="alg1.l29.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold"> do
</span>
</div>
<div id="alg1.l30" class="ltx_listingline">
          <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">30:</span>
          
          
        <span id="alg1.l30.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">     if </span><math id="alg1.l30.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="i\in\mathcal{I}_{&lt;t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℐ</mi><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i\in\mathcal{I}_{&lt;t}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="alg1.l30.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold"> then </span><span id="alg1.l30.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="float:right;"><math id="alg1.l30.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\triangleright" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>⊳</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\triangleright</annotation></semantics></math> Apply temporal filter to past visual tokens
</span>
</div>
<div id="alg1.l31" class="ltx_listingline">
          <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">31:</span>
          
          
        <span id="alg1.l31.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">      </span><math id="alg1.l31.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\hat{\psi}_{i}^{h}\leftarrow\psi_{i}^{h}\cdot\mathbbm{1}[\rho_{i}^{h}\geq\tau^{h}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>ψ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>i</mi><mi>h</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><msubsup><mi>ψ</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>h</mi></msubsup><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mn>𝟙</mn><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msubsup><mi>ρ</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>h</mi></msubsup><mo>≥</mo><msup><mi>τ</mi><mi>h</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\hat{\psi}_{i}^{h}\leftarrow\psi_{i}^{h}\cdot\mathbbm{1}[\rho_{i}^{h}\geq\tau^{h}]</annotation></semantics></math><span id="alg1.l31.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">
</span>
</div>
<div id="alg1.l32" class="ltx_listingline">
          <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">32:</span>
          
          
        <span id="alg1.l32.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">     else</span><span id="alg1.l32.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="float:right;"><math id="alg1.l32.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\triangleright" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>⊳</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\triangleright</annotation></semantics></math> Keep spatial score for current visual and all text tokens
</span>
</div>
<div id="alg1.l33" class="ltx_listingline">
          <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">33:</span>
          
          
        <span id="alg1.l33.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">      </span><math id="alg1.l33.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\hat{\psi}_{i}^{h}\leftarrow\psi_{i}^{h}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>ψ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>i</mi><mi>h</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><msubsup><mi>ψ</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>h</mi></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\hat{\psi}_{i}^{h}\leftarrow\psi_{i}^{h}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="alg1.l33.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">
</span>
</div>
<div id="alg1.l34" class="ltx_listingline">
          <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">34:</span>
          
          
        <span id="alg1.l34.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">     end if</span>
</div>
<div id="alg1.l35" class="ltx_listingline">
          <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">35:</span>
          
          
        <span id="alg1.l35.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">   end for</span>
</div>
<div id="alg1.l36" class="ltx_listingline">
          <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">36:</span>
          
          
        <span id="alg1.l36.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">   Let </span><math id="alg1.l36.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k\leftarrow\lceil n\cdot\gamma\rceil" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">⌈</mo><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mi>γ</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">⌉</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k\leftarrow\lceil n\cdot\gamma\rceil</annotation></semantics></math><span id="alg1.l36.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold"> </span><span id="alg1.l36.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="float:right;"><math id="alg1.l36.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\triangleright" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>⊳</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\triangleright</annotation></semantics></math> Number of tokens to keep based on budget
</span>
</div>
<div id="alg1.l37" class="ltx_listingline">
          <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">37:</span>
          
          
        <span id="alg1.l37.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">   </span><math id="alg1.l37.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{C}_{\hat{\psi}^{h}}^{h}\leftarrow\text{indices of top-}k\text{ tokens from }\mathcal{C}\text{ based on scores }\hat{\bm{\psi}}^{h}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒞</mi><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>ψ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>h</mi></msup><mi>h</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_bold">indices of top-</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>k</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_bold"> tokens from </mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒞</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_bold"> based on scores </mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>𝝍</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>h</mi></msup></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{C}_{\hat{\psi}^{h}}^{h}\leftarrow\text{indices of top-}k\text{ tokens from }\mathcal{C}\text{ based on scores }\hat{\bm{\psi}}^{h}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="alg1.l37.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">.
</span>
</div>
<div id="alg1.l38" class="ltx_listingline">
          <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">38:</span>
          
          
        <span id="alg1.l38.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">end for</span>
</div>
<div id="alg1.l39" class="ltx_listingline">
          <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">39:</span>
          
          
        <span id="alg1.l39.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">return </span><math id="alg1.l39.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\{\mathcal{C}_{\hat{\psi}^{h}}^{h}\}_{h=1}^{H}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒞</mi><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>ψ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>h</mi></msup><mi>h</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>H</mi></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\{\mathcal{C}_{\hat{\psi}^{h}}^{h}\}_{h=1}^{H}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="alg1.l39.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold"> </span><span id="alg1.l39.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="float:right;"><math id="alg1.l39.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\triangleright" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>⊳</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\triangleright</annotation></semantics></math> Return the set of indices to keep for each head
</span>
</div>
</div>
</figure>
<section id="A1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_font_bold ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix"><span id="A1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium">Appendix A</span> </span>Details of <span id="A1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">GUI-KV</span></h2>

<div id="A1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">We provide a detailed algorithmic description of our KV cache compression method in Algorithm </span><a href="#alg1" title="Algorithm 1 ‣ GUI-KV: Efficient GUI Agents via KV Cache with Spatio-Temporal Awareness" class="ltx_ref ltx_font_bold"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">1</span></a><span id="A1.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">. The algorithm combines spatial saliency guidance with temporal redundancy scoring to selectively retain the most informative tokens in the KV cache. The process consists of three main steps: (1) computing spatial saliency scores that combine attention weights with hidden state norms, (2) identifying temporally redundant tokens through subspace projection, and (3) combining both signals to select the final set of tokens for retention.</span></p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A2" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_font_bold ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix"><span id="A2.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium">Appendix B</span> </span>Further Discussions</h2>

<section id="A2.SS1" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_font_bold ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection"><span id="A2.SS1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium">B.1</span> </span>Compression Overhead</h3>

<div id="A2.SS1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A2.SS1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.SS1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">We profile the computation introduced by </span><span id="A2.SS1.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold ltx_font_smallcaps">GUI-KV</span><span id="A2.SS1.p1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold"> during the prefill phase and observe that it is negligible relative to the attention scoring computation. We measure the overhead using UI-TARS-1.5-7B on the AgentNetBench benchmark. As summarized in </span><a href="#A2.T3" title="In B.2 The Impact of 𝑟 in Temporal Redundancy Scoring ‣ Appendix B Further Discussions ‣ GUI-KV: Efficient GUI Agents via KV Cache with Spatio-Temporal Awareness" class="ltx_ref ltx_font_bold"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Table</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3</span></a><span id="A2.SS1.p1.1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">, attention scoring dominates the cost, while QR decomposition, top-</span><math id="A2.SS1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>k</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k</annotation></semantics></math><span id="A2.SS1.p1.1.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold"> selection (0.007 GFLOPs;  0.15%), and memory gathering (0.057 GFLOPs;  1.22%) together contribute under 2% overhead. Consequently, the QR-based subspace projection in our proposed method adds a vanishingly small fraction to prefill-time computation and does not hinder throughput.</span></p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A2.SS2" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_font_bold ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection"><span id="A2.SS2.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium">B.2</span> </span>The Impact of <math id="A2.SS2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="r" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>r</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">r</annotation></semantics></math> in Temporal Redundancy Scoring</h3>

<div id="A2.SS2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A2.SS2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.SS2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">We aim to understand the impact of different values of </span><math id="A2.SS2.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="r" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>r</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">r</annotation></semantics></math><span id="A2.SS2.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">. We vary different values of </span><math id="A2.SS2.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="r" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>r</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">r</annotation></semantics></math><span id="A2.SS2.p1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold"> and test UI-TARS-1.5-7B on AgentNetBench. </span><a href="#A2.T4" title="In B.2 The Impact of 𝑟 in Temporal Redundancy Scoring ‣ Appendix B Further Discussions ‣ GUI-KV: Efficient GUI Agents via KV Cache with Spatio-Temporal Awareness" class="ltx_ref ltx_font_bold"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Table</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4</span></a><span id="A2.SS2.p1.1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold"> show the results. We found that various values of </span><math id="A2.SS2.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="r" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>r</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">r</annotation></semantics></math><span id="A2.SS2.p1.1.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold"> does not yield significantly different results as all settings outperforming the other baselines in </span><a href="#S4.T1" title="In 4 Experiments ‣ GUI-KV: Efficient GUI Agents via KV Cache with Spatio-Temporal Awareness" class="ltx_ref ltx_font_bold"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Table</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">1</span></a><span id="A2.SS2.p1.1.6" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">. Among these values, </span><math id="A2.SS2.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="r=32" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>32</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">r=32</annotation></semantics></math><span id="A2.SS2.p1.1.7" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold"> results in the best overall performance.</span></p>
</div>
<figure id="A2.T3" class="ltx_table">
